<!doctype html><html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>identity · 邀请链接管理</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles.css"><script src="/admin.js" defer></script></head><body><a class="skip" href="#platforms">跳到平台列表</a><div class="shell"><header><strong class="brand">identity · 邀请链接管理</strong><span>本机单管理员工作台</span></header><main><div class="intro"><h1>管理官网购买入口</h1><p>保存完整邀请链接，再更新本地导航。规则来源与已有账户续费入口保持官方地址。</p></div><div class="toolbar"><form action="/build" method="post"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="{{.Token}}"><button type="submit">更新本地导航</button></form><a class="quiet button" href="/preview/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">打开导航预览</a><a href="/backup">下载 JSON 备份</a></div>{{if .Message}}<p class="message" role="status">{{.Message}}</p>{{end}}{{if .Error}}<p class="warning" role="alert">{{.Error}}</p>{{end}}<div class="filters" id="admin-filters" hidden><label class="search">搜索平台<input id="search" type="search" placeholder="平台名称、别名或域名"></label><label>配置状态<select id="state"><option value="">全部</option><option value="yes">已配置</option><option value="no">未配置</option></select></label><p id="count" role="status">{{len .Rows}} 个平台</p></div><p id="empty" hidden>没有匹配平台。请清空搜索或切换配置状态。</p><div class="ledger" id="platforms">{{range .Rows}}<article class="admin-row" data-search="{{.Provider.Name}} {{range .Provider.Aliases}}{{.}} {{end}}{{.Provider.URL}}" data-state="{{if .Configured}}yes{{else}}no{{end}}"><div class="rowhead"><h2>{{.Provider.Name}}</h2><span class="tag">{{if .Configured}}已配置邀请{{else}}使用官方链接{{end}}</span></div><dl><dt>官方入口</dt><dd><a href="{{.Provider.URL}}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{{.Provider.URL}}</a></dd><dt>当前配置购买入口</dt><dd class="current">{{.Current}}</dd></dl><p class="muted">未配置时，导航产品优先使用对应产品官网入口。修改后须重新生成导航才会生效。</p><details {{if .Editing}}open{{end}}><summary>编辑邀请链接</summary><form action="/save" method="post" class="edit" data-hosts="{{range .Provider.Hosts}}{{.}} {{end}}"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="{{$.Token}}"><input type="hidden" name="revision" value="{{$.Revision}}"><input type="hidden" name="id" value="{{.Provider.ID}}"><label>完整 HTTPS 邀请链接<input name="url" type="url" value="{{.Input}}" maxlength="4096" required autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" aria-describedby="help-{{.Provider.ID}}"></label><p id="help-{{.Provider.ID}}" class="url-help" role="status">允许域名：{{range .Provider.Hosts}}{{.}} {{end}}。仅校验与展示，不访问输入的链接。</p><button type="submit">保存链接</button></form><form action="/restore" method="post"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="{{$.Token}}"><input type="hidden" name="revision" value="{{$.Revision}}"><input type="hidden" name="id" value="{{.Provider.ID}}"><button class="quiet" type="submit">恢复官方链接</button></form></details></article>{{end}}</div></main><footer>配置仅在本机保存。邀请链接会随购买外链公开；表单防护值不会写入导航。</footer></div></body></html>
